# TDX (Transport Data eXchange) — OIDC Client Credentials
# Sign up at https://tdx.transportdata.tw/ , log into 會員中心 → API金鑰管理
# to obtain a Client ID and Client Secret. The free tier allows 50 req/sec
# and 50,000 calls/day, plenty for this project.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (which is gitignored) and fill in your
# real credentials. Never commit `.env.local` to git.
TDX_CLIENT_ID=your-tdx-client-id-here
TDX_CLIENT_SECRET=your-tdx-client-secret-here
